reasons={11:'An indefinite controller cycle despite a reachable goal is a counterexample to Bug0 completeness, not geometric impossibility or a finite detour.',16:'Projecting the goal onto every polygon edge selects(10,1), distance sqrt5. Perimeter28; H-to-leave arcs13 and15, so Bug1 travels28+13=41. First closer original y=0 crossing is(6,0), reached after2+4+2=8; Bug2 leaves there. Both outgoing rays locally free.',21:'The original-line crossing is closer(5<8) with locally free forward motion, so leave immediately. Full survey and later crossing comparison are Bug1-like additions, not Bug2.',27:'Repeated obstacle/clear switching induces chattering between modes and oscillatory commands. Smoothing and hysteresis are mitigations, not the stated failure; a fixed delay does not capture alternating modes.',38:'Supplied >= gives free,blocked,blocked. The actual slide says above/below and leaves equality unspecified; source does not mandate this tie rule.',43:'Chord w=2R sin(20°/2) gives .6945927 and1.3891854m. Required .6+2(.1)=.8m. Only farther passes. Half-chord and full-angle substitutions reproduce alternatives.',47:'Threshold>=5 and90mask leave circular runs[300,330,0,30] and[120,150,180], midpoints345and150. Wrapped costs:345=>5×35+2×165+2×165=835;150=>5×130=650, selected150. Ignorehistory yields175; omittingmask gives135cost635. Unlike the prior impossible error triple, all reference directions are coherent.',62:'Six independent joint coordinates define six-dimensional configuration, distinct from workspace3D, restricted task coordinates or12D position/velocity state.',63:'Red point is one joint pair outside modeled colliding set. It certifies neither a complete route nor arbitrary linear interpolation; C-obstacle includes whole modeled arm, and joint-space drawn distance is not Cartesian metres.',77:'Differentiable local minimum has zero gradient: positive scalar step leaves zero unchanged, and potential constant offset does not change gradient. Local stalling is not a proof of global infeasibility.',79:'Printed supervised example explicitly says CNN classify/segment obstacles from camera images. Other listed tasks may be learned but are not this cited example.',83:'The reward-based method can be shared while policy action dimensions/semantics and control mapping match each mechanism. Numeric normalization or matching rewards does not establish transfer.'}
